   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam Sverige</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam Sweden is a global movement of people fighting every day for an equal and just world without poverty where everyone is equal and rights are respected and fulfilled, and where people can influence their own lives.
Vision
An equal world that is fair and sustainable; a world where people and planet are respected in just economic systems; a world where women and girls live free from gender-based violence and discrimination. Where the climate crisis is addressed in the way it needs to be, and where those in power take responsibility and are held accountable for their actions.

Large-scale change is possible when we act in solidarity with people living in poverty and facing injustice and oppression. Millions of people across the world are mobilising and raising their voices against inequality, poverty and exclusion. Together for an equal future.</narrative>
